##  Spatial Ties and the Weights Matrix (Review)
##  ICPSR 2026 Spatial Econometrics Workshop
##  Instructor: Scott J. Cook and Jude Hays
# Clean workspace. Better still: Restart R (though this can cause issues in labs)
